The copyright holders referred to as "The trysquare Authors" in LICENSE.

Naming them collectively there, and enumerating them here, is what keeps LICENSE
unchanged as the list grows. It is a designation and not an assignment: copyright
vests in each author, and work produced in an institutional frame may leave rights
with that institution whatever this file says.

